    "Id": "mechdef_viper_VPR-M",
    "Name": "Viper M",
    "Details": "Introduced in 2940, the Viper is a 40-ton OmniMech that emphasizes speed and armor, with only 8.5 tons of podspace available for weapons. A 320-rated XL Engine powers the Viper and 8 Jump Jets are hardwired into the chassis, further improving the mobility. The Viper M is armed with paired ER Medium Lasers and Medium Pulse Lasers. A Targeting Computer improves the accuracy of the Lasers and a Micro Pulse Laser fills the remaining half ton. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Long</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.03</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_viper"
  },
